{
  "_about": "Batch 5: sequels opened by flags from batches 1-4. Every scenario can be reached from something already written, but several can ALSO be reached from scenarios not written yet, so keep the text general where noted. Every flag in _info.must_set_flags must be set by some choice; where there are none, set no flags. Callbacks: HS_094 <- HS_003 'Step in and help him find it' (you stood up for a freshman whose gear upperclassmen hid); he is now an older teammate who remembers. HS_046 <- HS_030 'Offer to work through it' (you helped {tyler} reset after a rough practice as sophomores; mutual respect). HS_153 <- HS_107 (volunteered a full morning setting up a youth sports field) or HS_134 (the league thanked you) or a summer job (not written yet): keep it about someone in the community who has seen your work. HS_156 <- mentoring a younger student (HS_126), owning an old group chat (HS_139), volunteering (HS_107), or team leadership (not written yet): keep it about a younger athlete who has noticed how you carry yourself, without naming one moment. HS_147 <- HS_005, where {tyler} became either a training partner OR a hostile rival: the text must work for both. You've won the starting job over him. HS_092 <- HS_005 hostile rivalry: {tyler} has been your rival since freshman year; senior year, weeks 8-10. HS_159 <- holder trust (HS_145) OR team leadership or coach confidence (not written yet): the last practice of senior year with {coach} and {holder}; don't assume which path led here. Pronouns: {tyler} and {parent} are male; never he/she for {holder}, {best_friend}, {coach}, {teacher}, {love_interest}. Scenarios happen off the field: never describe a game kick or its result.",
